{"seq":11,"slug":"message-queue-async-patterns","title":"消息队列与异步模式","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"消息队列与异步模式\">消息队列与异步模式</h1><p>消息队列是构建松耦合、可扩展分布式系统的核心基础设施，通过异步解耦生产者与消费者，让系统的各部分能够独立扩展和演进。本 Hub 聚焦于<strong>消息队列的设计模式与工程实践</strong>——从核心概念到主流系统，从异步设计模式到可靠性工程，帮助读者建立&quot;如何用异步消息驱动构建健壮的后端系统&quot;的完整认知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的边界\">本 Hub 的边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>本 Hub 覆盖</th>\n<th>不覆盖（看其他 Hub）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消息队列基础与模式</td>\n<td>发布订阅、点对点、消息顺序、死信队列</td>\n<td>事件驱动整体架构（<code>15_event-driven-architecture</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saga 与事件溯源</td>\n<td>Saga 两种实现、事件溯源基础</td>\n<td>分布式事务全面比较（<code>08_distributed-transactions-consistency</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主流系统实践</td>\n<td>Kafka 深度、RabbitMQ 模式、Redis Streams</td>\n<td>流处理（<code>13_stream-processing</code> in data-science）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性工程</td>\n<td>背压、Schema 演进、可观测性</td>\n<td>分布式追踪系统实现（<code>05_observability-engineering</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>第 1 章 消息队列基础</strong>：理解核心概念（消息模型、投递语义、顺序保证），建立正确的认知基础。</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章 异步设计模式</strong>：掌握 Saga、事件溯源、死信队列等高级模式，解决分布式场景的核心挑战。</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章 主流系统实践</strong>：深入 Kafka/RabbitMQ/Redis Streams 的实现细节，与具体系统对话。</li>\n<li><strong>第 4 章 工程质量</strong>：解决背压、Schema 演进、可观测性等让系统长期可维护的工程问题。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>HTTP 同步请求/响应模型（理解异步的对比参照）</li>\n<li>分布式系统基础（网络不可靠、节点可能宕机）</li>\n<li>了解 Docker/Kubernetes 基础（Kafka/RabbitMQ 的实际部署）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>08_distributed-transactions-consistency</code>：分布式事务的全面比较（2PC、Saga、TCC）</li>\n<li><code>15_event-driven-architecture</code>：以事件为核心的整体架构风格</li>\n<li><code>05_observability-engineering</code>：消息系统的监控与追踪基础设施</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"消息队列基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"message-queue-concepts","title":"消息队列核心概念：生产者、消费者与 Broker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/fundamentals/message-queue-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pubsub-vs-queue","title":"发布订阅与点对点队列：两种消息模型的选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/fundamentals/pubsub-vs-queue"},{"seq":3,"slug":"message-ordering-delivery","title":"消息顺序与投递语义：顺序保证与投递模式的工程权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/fundamentals/message-ordering-delivery"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"第二章：分布式消息模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-choreography","title":"Saga 模式：分布式事务的编排与协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/saga-choreography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-sourcing-messaging","title":"事件溯源与消息系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/event-sourcing-messaging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dead-letter-queue","title":"死信队列与消息错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/dead-letter-queue"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"第三章：消息队列系统深度实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kafka-in-depth","title":"Kafka 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/kafka-in-depth"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rabbitmq-patterns","title":"RabbitMQ 模式与高可用配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/rabbitmq-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"redis-streams-nats","title":"Redis Streams 与 NATS 消息系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/redis-streams-nats"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"第四章：异步系统工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-flow-control","title":"背压与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/backpressure-flow-control"},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-schema-evolution","title":"消息 Schema 演进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/message-schema-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-observability","title":"异步系统可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/async-observability"}]}]}